   "section": "mod-tome/class/interface/TooltipsData.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "#GOLD#Crit Reduction#LAST#\nCrit reduction reduces the chance an opponent has of landing a critical strike with a melee or ranged attack.\n",
   "target": "#GOLD#暴击减免#LAST#\n暴击减免降低你受到近战或远程攻击暴击的概率。\n",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/class/interface/TooltipsData.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    315
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "f1951ec65ddb",
   "unit_id": "f1951ec65ddbb15ebbfd4077f2cab32cff54cf9590c9eb9e63cff56cc2d4c7b7",
   "revision_key": "1a152d3d6ec5a7707637329ef7c0e31f2a24b415ae60abf3dc9afe0e43d607ae",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 22278,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/chronomancy/spacetime-folding.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Learn to lay Warp Mines in a radius of 1.  Warp Mines teleport targets that trigger them either toward you or away from you depending on the type of mine used and inflict %0.2f physical and %0.2f temporal (warp) damage.\n\t\tThe mines are hidden traps (%d detection and %d disarm power based on your Magic), last for %d turns, and each have a ten turn cooldown.\n\t\tInvesting in this talent improves the range of all Spacetime Folding talents and the damage caused by your Warp Mines will improve with your Spellpower.\n\t\t\n\t\tCurrent Spacetime Folding Range: %d",
   "target": "学会在半径 1 的范围内埋设时空地雷。时空地雷会根据所用地雷的类型，将触发它们的目标传送到你身边或远离你的地方，并造成 %0.2f 物理和 %0.2f 时空（扭曲）伤害。\n\t\t地雷是隐藏的陷阱（侦测强度 %d， 解除强度 %d， 基于你的魔力），持续 %d 回合，各有 10 回合冷却时间。\n\t\t在该技能上投入点数会提升所有时空折叠系技能的范围，时空地雷的伤害也会随你的法术强度提升。\n\t\t\n\t\t当前时空折叠范围： %d",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/chronomancy/spacetime-folding.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    238
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "742310b3eeff",
   "unit_id": "742310b3eeff204a3151c2bd0dc584bb6bca61baebce177f671c3a03e29e7efe",
   "revision_key": "676bf0733f05c6667e7a73e016ab07e4f8913de14047ea08306d146a0f2f557a",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 22351,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/chronomancy/speed-control.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "When you use a non-instant chronomancy spell you gain %d%% attack, spell, and mind speed for %d turns.  This effect stacks up to three times but can only occur once per turn.\n\t\t",
   "target": "当你使用非瞬发时空系法术时，你获得 %d%% 攻击、施法和精神速度，持续 %d 回合。该效果最多叠加三次，但每回合只能触发一次。\n\t\t",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/chronomancy/speed-control.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    62
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5e6fbc802f83",
   "unit_id": "5e6fbc802f83437c44e88b01695ed57fcc1d4ac472dccbe1e1e1d56709752afe",
   "revision_key": "3a8e06fc4aee7e4248675187aca938418314e607bc5fa902b773df019d28b5d9",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 22807,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/corruptions/plague.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Whenever you deal non-disease blight damage you apply a disease dealing %0.2f blight damage per turn for 6 turns and reducing one of its physical stats (strength, constitution, dexterity) by %d. The three diseases can stack.\n\t\tVirulent Disease will always try to apply a disease the target does not currently have, and also one that will have the most debilitating effect for the target.\n\t\tThis disease will try to prioritize being applied to an enemy with a high disease count near the target.\n\t\tThe effect will increase with your Spellpower.",
   "target": "每当你造成非疾病来源的枯萎伤害时，你将会对目标施加一项疾病，每回合造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害，持续 6 回合，并使其一项物理属性（力量、体质或敏捷）降低 %d 点。三种疾病可以叠加。\n\t\t剧毒瘟疫总是会试图施加一项目标当前尚未感染、且对目标负面效果最大的疾病。\n\t\t该疾病会优先施加在目标附近疾病数量较多的敌人身上。\n\t\t疾病效果随法术强度提升。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/corruptions/plague.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    91
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "e60e9872f1d7",
   "unit_id": "e60e9872f1d7b9f2fb249ae0777a86d7a79fe91dfc8c72910ded0f4a8a102a99",
   "revision_key": "7ebe0fca62ee5b15947244afaca32a2ee9d44e047e48c69b256407ba7a38fa42",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 24492,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cursed/shadows.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Instill hate in your shadows, strengthening their attacks. They gain %d%% extra Accuracy and %d%% extra damage. The fury of their attacks gives them the ability to try to Dominate their foes, increasing all damage taken by that foe for 4 turns (level %d, %d%% chance at range 1). They also gain the ability to Fade when hit, avoiding all damage until their next turn (%d turn cooldown).",
   "target": "将仇恨注入你的阴影，强化它们的攻击。它们获得 %d%% 额外命中和 %d%% 额外伤害加成。它们疯狂的攻击让它们能够尝试支配对手，被支配目标受到的所有伤害提高，持续 4 回合（等级 %d， 在 1 格范围内有 %d%% 几率触发）。它们同时拥有消隐的能力：受到攻击时免疫所有伤害，直到下一回合开始 （%d 回合冷却时间）。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/cursed/shadows.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    526
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c0655746430c",
   "unit_id": "c0655746430ccc5161cf26aa563a785455bcc14caad24ff1c96fc4c74c1cc037",
   "revision_key": "06bf72e4bad644c425fe599ca4aab806086f9a7b2c90fd7ec21f595fbd1d4e53",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 24494,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cursed/shadows.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Infuse magic into your shadows to give them fearsome spells. Your shadows receive a bonus of %d to their Spellpower.\n\t\tYour shadows can strike adjacent foes with Lightning (level %d, %d%% chance at range 1).\n\t\tAt level 3 your shadows can sear their enemies from a distance with Flames (level %d, %d%% chance at range 2 to 6).\n\t\tAt level 5 when your shadows are struck down they will attempt to Reform, becoming whole again (50%% chance).",
   "target": "灌输魔力给你的阴影使它们学会可怕的法术。你的阴影获得 %d 点法术强度加成。\n\t\t你的阴影可以用暗影闪电攻击附近的目标（等级 %d， 在 1 格范围内有 %d%% 几率触发）。\n\t\t等级 3 时你的阴影可以远距离使用暗影之火灼烧你的敌人（等级 %d，%d%% 几率 2 到 6 格范围）。\n\t\t等级 5 时你的阴影在被击倒时有 50%% 几率重组并重新加入战斗。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/cursed/shadows.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    599
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "a8b7cd89fe7f",
   "unit_id": "a8b7cd89fe7fd1d8993263485055f1e85e75e54e0261c5dafe1587bf660c5e75",
   "revision_key": "362741743af21c6a815550ee172291144b7f03945ebebeeae6bcf17a44675ca1",
