   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/spells/stone.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Concentrate on maintaining a Crystalline Focus, increasing all your physical damage by %0.1f%% and ignoring %d%% physical resistance of your targets.\n\t\tAlso raises your physical and magical saves by %d.",
   "target": "你专注于维持水晶力场，使你造成的所有物理伤害增加 %0.1f%%， 并忽略目标 %d%% 的物理伤害抗性。\n\t\t同时增加你 %d 点物理和法术豁免。",
