   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/techniques/reflexes.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You take close notice of the target for the next 5 turns. If they attempt to use a non-instant talent you react with incredible speed, firing a shot dealing 25%% damage that causes the talent to fail and go on cooldown.\nThis shot is instant, cannot miss, and puts %d other talents on cooldown for %d turns.",
   "target": "你在接下来的 5 回合内密切关注目标。当其使用非瞬发技能时，你立刻做出反应，射出一箭造成 25%% 伤害打断技能并使其进入冷却。\n该射击为瞬发，但可能未命中；命中时会使其它 %d 个技能进入冷却 %d 回合。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/reflexes.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
