   "source": "When you kill a foe you place small explosives with shrapnels inside its body, making it explode in radius %d.\n\t\tAny foes hit will bleed for %0.2f damage per turn for 6 turns. The shrapnels also damage the vocal cords (or related organ), silencing them for %d turns.\n\t\t#{italic}#Use the finest of wartech now: shrapnels. For blood and mayhem!#{normal}#",
   "target": "每次以武器攻击击杀敌人时，将带有弹片的小型爆炸物植入其体内，使其在半径 %d 格内爆炸。\n\t\t爆炸范围内除你以外的所有生物（包括友方）每回合受到 %0.2f 流血伤害，持续 6 回合。弹片还会损伤他们的声带（或相关器官），使其沉默 %d 回合。\n\t\t#{italic}#使用战争技术的精华——弹片。为了鲜血与混乱！#{normal}#",
